Third-party dependencies

Every Python package in this repository declares zero runtime dependencies.
The Rust, Go and TypeScript components depend on third-party crates, modules
and packages under their own licences. A machine-readable inventory is produced
by `make sbom` (CycloneDX), and dependency licences are checked in CI.
